# There are no places here, so the veil becomes a mark on what it caught, like
# Poison Mist: the cast is the first strike and the burn carries twelve, hence
# 10.8s instead of GMS's 12.
#
# The stealth half is dropped: Advanced Dark Sight here is only final damage.
name: "Shadow Veil"
description:
  "Summons a dark ally to deal damage over time."
